I will use a JSON merge patch to add the required volume and mount point.

The patch should look like this:

```json
[
  {
    "op": "add",
    "path": "/spec/template/spec/volumes",
    "value": [
      {
        "name": "writable-data",
        "emptyDir": {}
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "op": "add",
    "path": "/spec/template/spec/containers/0/volumeMounts",
    "value": [
      {
        "name": "writable-data",
        "mountPath": "/tmp"
      }
    ]
  }
]
```

I will execute this patch now.

